* October 9th - '''Rare Atom''' move [[Marek]] to a player role. <ref name="2025 Marek">{{cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1121710243565273091|title=我们又收到Major的邀请函啦|trans_title=We received another invitation to the Major|language={{flag|cn}} Simplified Chinese|author='''Rare Atom'''|date=2025-10-09}}</ref>
* October 24th - '''Rare Atom''' move [[kaze]] to assistant coach. <ref name="2025 kaze">{{cite web|url=https://weibo.com/7736530902/5225286417519368|title=Andrew Khong（ID：kaze）选手将加入教练组，转为选手兼教练的Playing Coach角色|trans_title=Andrew Khong (ID: kaze) has joined our coaching roster and has taken on the role of Playing Coach|language={{flag|cn}} Simplified Chinese|author='''Rare Atom'''|date=2025-10-24}}</ref>
* December 10th - '''Rare Atom''' part ways with [[Marek]]. <ref name="-Marek">{{cite web|url=https://weibo.com/7736530902/QhLbRvrMG|title=RA电子竞技俱乐部CS分部人员变动公告|trans_title=Rare Atom Counter-Strike Roster Change Announcement|language={{flag|cn}} Simplified Chinese|author='''Rare Atom'''|date=2025-12-10}}</ref>
* December 11th - '''Rare Atom''' acquire [[chengking]] from [[FengDa Gaming]]. <ref name="chengking">{{cite web|url=https://weibo.com/7736530902/QhTDu08qK|title=RA电子竞技俱乐部CS分部人员变动公告|trans_title=Rare Atom Counter-Strike Roster Change Announcement|language={{flag|cn}} Simplified Chinese|author='''Rare Atom'''|date=2025-12-11}}</ref>

|content5=
* March 8th - '''Rare Atom''' acquire [[x9]] from [[FengDa Gaming]]. <ref name="+x9">{{cite web|url=https://weibo.com/7736530902/5274165054800023|title=RA电子竞技俱乐部CS分部人员变动公告|trans_title=Rare Atom Counter-Strike Roster Change Announcement|language={{flag|cn}} Simplified Chinese|date=2026-03-08|author='''Rare Atom'''}}</ref>
