|content1=
*January 27th - '''SINNERS Esports''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' by signing a lineup consisting of [[CaNNiE]], [[beastik]], [[ZEDKO]], [[SHOCK]], and [[NEOFRAG]]. <ref name="CS">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/sinnersesports/posts/194959041897958|title=Sinners Esports Introduction to the world!|date=2020-01-27|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*March 11th - '''SINNERS Esports''' sign [[efron]] as coach. <ref name="efron">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/sinnersesports/photos/a.190749008985628/231768458217016|title=Today we officially announce our new trainer EFRON!|date=2020-03-11|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*October 10th - '''SINNERS Esports''' sign [[Dukkha]] as an analyst. <ref name="Dukkha">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/sinnersesports/posts/410700746990452|title=Welcome in SINNERS, Bruno "Dukkha" Lopes|date=2020-10-10|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
